{
  "_readme": [
    "Fixed question set, written 2026-11-18 before scoring (#40). Each question is one a person would ask, with a known right answer.",
    "Runs offline: each step's `fixture` is the `result` (plus any paging fields) the Open Legislation API returned for that record, copied from the example responses in the API's own documentation (`fixture_source`), trimmed to the fields the question needs. A step with no fixture must not reach the API.",
    "So the set measures the server, not the model: does the tool send the documented request, and does its answer carry the right fact, the paging line and the source line. It does not measure whether a model picks the right tool.",
    "Checks: `request` (path and query parameters of the one API request), `json` (dotted path in the answer's JSON equals a value), `text` (a regular expression the answer text must match), `error` (true when the answer must be an error).",
    "Invariants checked on every answer: a data answer ends with a source line naming the New York State Senate, with a link and an as-of; no answer contains the API key.",
    "Run: npm run eval (results are written to eval/runs/). npm test runs the same set and fails if any question fails."
  ],
  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "Q01",
      "q": "Who sponsored Senate bill S2180 in the 2013 session?",
      "answer": "Martin J. Golden (Senate district 22).",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "get_bill",
          "args": { "print_no": "S2180", "session_year": 2013 },
          "fixture_source": "https://legislation.nysenate.gov/static/docs/html/bills.html#get-a-single-bill",
          "fixture": { "result": { "basePrintNo": "S2180", "session": 2013, "printNo": "S2180", "title": "Provides enhanced..", "sponsor": { "member": { "memberId": 422, "shortName": "GOLDEN", "sessionYear": 2013, "fullName": "Martin J. Golden", "districtCode": 22 }, "budget": false, "rules": false }, "status": { "statusType": "IN_SENATE_COMM", "statusDesc": "In Senate Committee", "actionDate": "2014-06-20", "committeeName": "RULES", "billCalNo": null } } },
          "check": {
            "request": { "path": "/api/3/bills/2013/S2180" },
            "json": { "sponsor.member.fullName": "Martin J. Golden", "sponsor.member.districtCode": 22, "url": "https://www.nysenate.gov/legislation/bills/2013/S2180" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
